# SynaptiqAI — Environment Variable Template
# Copy this file to .env for local development.
#
# SynaptiqAI is LOCAL-FIRST: user data stays in the browser's IndexedDB.
# No server-side secrets are needed for core functionality.
# Users configure their own AI API keys directly within the app.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI Provider Keys (NEVER put in source code)
# These belong to the USER and are configured in the app UI.
# They are stored encrypted in the user's own browser IndexedDB.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google OAuth Client ID
# This is configured by the user inside the app (Settings > Account)
# and stored in their own browser's localStorage.
# It is NOT a secret — it's a public OAuth identifier.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If you add a custom backend proxy (optional):
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.vercel.app
# INTERNAL_API_SECRET=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECURITY RULES:
# 1. NEVER commit actual key values to git.
# 2. Add .env to .gitignore.
# 3. Rotate any key that was accidentally committed.
# 4. AI provider keys are USER-OWNED — never use developer keys server-side.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
